sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Editor as Monaco Editor
    participant TS as TypeScript Compiler<br/>(in browser)
    participant Sandbox as Sandboxed iframe

    User->>Editor: Writes TypeScript code
    User->>Editor: Clicks "Run Code"
    Editor->>TS: Send source code
    TS->>TS: Transpile TS → JS
    alt Compilation Error
        TS-->>Editor: Return diagnostics
        Editor-->>User: Show error in output panel
    else Success
        TS->>Sandbox: Send transpiled JS
        Sandbox->>Sandbox: Execute JS<br/>(captures console.log)
        Sandbox-->>Editor: Return output
        Editor-->>User: Show output in panel
    end